.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form."] [:db/add "77f2b8ee-746d-57e4-872c-31a4c56792a3" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}5 & -15 & 65 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 20\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}5 & -15 & 65 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 20\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{5}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & 13 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 20\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & 13 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & 13 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "77f2b8ee-746d-57e4-872c-31a4c56792a3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "77f2b8ee-746d-57e4-872c-31a4c56792a3" :question/answer-fields "a6a62eb0-283c-5017-8a3e-f1e0d597ed95"] [:db/ensure "77f2b8ee-746d-57e4-872c-31a4c56792a3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059776 :knowledge-point/questions "77f2b8ee-746d-57e4-872c-31a4c56792a3"] [:db/add "d5f6956f-1833-5b7f-bf73-d46c1eed37da" :answer/id #uuid "d5f6956f-1833-5b7f-bf73-d46c1eed37da"] [:db/add "d5f6956f-1833-5b7f-bf73-d46c1eed37da" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d5f6956f-1833-5b7f-bf73-d46c1eed37da" :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -10 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -6\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "d5f6956f-1833-5b7f-bf73-d46c1eed37da" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8789353a-ffc8-517a-b9e9-a30e91e11164" :answer/id #uuid "8789353a-ffc8-517a-b9e9-a30e91e11164"] [:db/add "8789353a-ffc8-517a-b9e9-a30e91e11164" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8789353a-ffc8-517a-b9e9-a30e91e11164" :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -10 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -7\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "8789353a-ffc8-